  "bounded_factor_saturation": {
    "what_this_is": "reach AND exposure both at 1.0 -- the entire book on the SVT product every day of the year -- with the renewal route at zero, because that world has no renewal decision left to price. The SVT route then carries the whole band alone at the hazard this world runs. This is the two named factors at the most they can ever do.",
